        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88GB42-26, ADA Compliant 42\" Polished Chrome Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the attention to quality this solid brass 42\" polished chrome grab bar  made by Deltana. The modern style of the 88 series 42 inch bathroom grab bar allows it to look good while still being functional; and it is great for any contemporary setting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88GB42-specifications.gif?v=1704354561\" width=\"600\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88GB42 42\" Grab Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana 88GB42-26 42 Inch Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center From End Mount to Middle Mount: 21\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance From Wall to Bar: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88GB42.pdf?v=1691095379\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88GB42 42\" Grab Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 grab bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (1)  Left.\r\n</p>",
